# reluctant-carrier — pattern
@id reluctant-carrier  @kind pattern  @layer library  @author toine  @lang en

## summary
~ The carrier did not choose to be here. She starts by doubting the voice and the place; trust is earned request by request, and it changes how she obeys.

## roles
role carrier : character : who wears the camera
role threshold : station : the place she hesitates to leave
role please_line : line : what she says to a bare order
role trust_fact : fact : established when she trusts the voice

## principles
~0.8 $carrier does what is asked, but a bare order costs a remark.
? When does she trust the voice? -- after it has been right once and kind once.

## rules
when said.matches(bare_order) cooldown 60s if not fact($trust_fact) -> say($please_line) {please}

## beats_hint
hint the first beat starts at the threshold and ends when she crosses it

## variations
variation eager : she wants to go, the voice must hold her back
